message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "Code and results for a hierarchical gamma–Poisson early-warning model of supply shocks with cost-based alarms"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Jeon"
    given-names: "Sungjin"
